// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Seer_Scanner 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P888872627" "The Seers use their telepathic powers to root out anyone plotting against the status quo in Praetoria. Although they work in close concert with the PPD it is well known that they were created by Mother Mayhem and she ultimately controls their fate."
// DisplayNames :
"P2589124277" "Scanner"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Seer_Viewer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1861306912" "After a Scanner has been under Mother Mayhem's mind for a time one of three things happens. Most of them burn out. A smaller percentage shows no indication of greater ability and remains where they are in the ranks. Finally the smallest fraction demonstrates the ability to penetrate more deeply into a subjects mind and is advanced to Viewer status."
// DisplayNames :
"P82880867" "Viewer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Seer_Beholder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2961092773" "Beholder"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Seer_Tracker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2381445834" "Trackers are adept at picking out particular thoughts among the sea of confusion generated by the minds of Praetoria. They can be given a subject or word to listen for, pluck it out of the air, and lead PPD forces right to the person whose thoughts they are hunting."
// DisplayNames :
"P1675498291" "Tracker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Seer_Mindshadow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3614621111" "Mindshadows are the closest thing the Seers have to elite field agents. They are combat trained and their psychic link to T.E.S.T. Rangers gives them the ability to summon deadly back up."
// DisplayNames :
"P102902376" "Mindshadow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Seer_Visionary 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2921338750" "Visionaries are extremely powerful and quite rare among the seers. They are usually stationary and are very seldom called into field duty. If you see one it's far too late to run."
// DisplayNames :
"P1740640433" "Visionary"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Seer_Scryer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P818779251" "Scyers are among the elite of Mother Mayhem's Seers. They make up the rank and file combatants among the elite. They specialize in tearing their foes minds apart with their mental assault while peering into the mind of their foes to find their weakness."
// DisplayNames :
"P3655164509" "Scryer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Seer_Seeker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1707654086" "Seekers are among the elite of Mother Mayhem's Seers. They make up the rank and file combatants among the elite. Seekers have the ability to mend others wounds with their minds as well as augment their allies with mental wards."
// DisplayNames :
"P2230423493" "Seeker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Seer_Diviner 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1493841138" "Diviners are among the elite of Mother Mayhem's Seers. They are mid-rank combatants among the elite. They specialize in crushing their foes in close range combat."
// DisplayNames :
"P3601274040" "Diviner"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Seer_Augur 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1791998782" "Augurs are the elite amongst the Seers and are masters of mind control. They are capable of crippling their enemies with powerful mental assaults then moving in for the kill."
// DisplayNames :
"P1586206284" "Augur"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Assault_Trooper_Pet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1943650702" "Tyrant's Imperial Defense Force troopers are the most advanced soldiers in his arsenal. The IDF Assault Troopers are equipped with an upgraded Plasma Glove and Power Armor with jump boosters, making them resistant to all types of damage."
// DisplayNames :
"P2376363524" "Assault Trooper"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Ranger_Pet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2302002835" "Tyrant's Imperial Defense Force troopers are the most advanced soldiers in his arsenal. The IDF Rangers are equipped with an upgraded Plasma Glove and Power Armor, making them resistant to all types of damage."
// DisplayNames :
"P1681294533" "Ranger"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_1381 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1388992941" "Katie Douglas, aka Seer 1381, has broken free of the Seer Network. She is now on a race against time to save her family before time runs out for her."
// DisplayNames :
"P1078912095" "Katie Douglas"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_MotherMayhem 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2657870840" "Luckily, this is not actually Mother Mayhem, but rather the lingering psychic impression of her presence within a Seer's mind."
// DisplayNames :
"P1782211024" "Presence of Mother Mayhem"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Former_Seer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P33553179" "These psychics were former Seers, but have since been removed from the Seer Network. Though no longer drawing strength from the network their minds are also no longer restrained and possess great psychic power."
// DisplayNames :
"P2410521981" "Former Seer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Former_Seer_Emma 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1855052190" "This woman was a former Seer. Her cybernetic implants have been removed and she is no longer a part of the Seer Network. The safety parameters provided by the network to reinforce self control are no longer in place, and she is in great danger to not only herself, but anyone around her."
// DisplayNames :
"P661089092" "Emma"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Seer_0001 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4197748852" "Seer 0001 is the first Seer created to defend Praetoria city. She is also Katie Douglas' mother."
// DisplayNames :
"P832572598" "Seer 0001"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_P_Simon_Omega 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2477104100" "Simon is a renegade psychic who has evaded Mother Mayhem and her Seers for years. Additionally, all attempts to recruit Simon by either the Syndicate, or the Resistance, have ended violently."
// DisplayClassName :
"P688723465" "Renegade Psychic"
// DisplayNames :
"P4158626251" "Simon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Harbinger 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2896182745" "Harbinger is an elite member of the Seers who holds the rank of Augur. She has been sent to provide command and control of the Failed Experiments; disposable troops for the war against Primal Earth."
// DisplayNames :
"P84655516" "Harbinger"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Harbinger_Marker_A 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2775105057" "This entity stays around until told to die."
// DisplayNames :
"P2237867464" "Marker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Harbinger_Marker_B 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Harbinger_Marker_C 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Harbinger_Marker_D 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Seer_Augur_NoPets 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Former_Seeker_01 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2816817276" "These powerful psychics were former Seers, but have since been removed from the Seer Network. Katie Douglas has taken them under her wing in First Ward, training them to harness their now-unrestrained psychic powers, and protecting them from those who would once again use them as weapons."
// DisplayNames :
"P3364018819" "Former Seeker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Former_Seeker_02 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Civilian_Patient 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3635162967" "This civilian is a powerful mentalist, ripe with potential for joining the ranks of the Seers."
// DisplayNames :
"P1504877703" "Civilian Patient"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Seer_Patient 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1230308305" "Seer Patient"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - PraetorianSeers_Seer_Patient_Op 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1552880882" "Seer Patient Op"

