"P3362526163" "The biggest and most dangerous of the Red Caps, the Fiends are no one to be trifled with. Fiends are known for sharpening their teeth on the bones of their victims, and that is by no means their most repugnant quality."
// DisplayNames :
"P2818705630" "Fiend"

