// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3459409289" "The true nature of the Will o' the Wisps is a matter of some controversy among paranormal experts. Many believe that they are the byproducts of the Red Caps magic. They seem to be both intelligent and malevolent, and they will harm any person who comes near."
// DisplayNames :
"P1730922461" "Will o' the Wisp"

