"P1014712516" "No Rikti warriors are more feared than those known as the 4 Riders. Said to have suffered some strange transformation during the crossing between worlds even their fellow Rikti are terrified of them. The Rider known as Scarcity can starve his foes of life and energy, destroying them form within."
// DisplayNames :
"P1215352652" "Scarcity"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Rikti_Heavy_Assault_Scarcity_Teleporting 
