// Villain Def - Romans_Good_Legionarii 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2985271558" "The Legionarii is the backbone to Imperious' army. Ever true to their emperor, despite the odds they face, these men fight harder and longer than any other forces on the battlefield."
// DisplayNames :

