// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RuluShin_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P357426778" "Those who have shown great physical prowress in the Rulu-Shin are sent the front lines in the battle for Rularuu's power. They are called the Might of Rularuu, for they enforce Rularuu's might where he cannot - for now."
// DisplayNames :
"P3433226827" "Rularuu's Might"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RuluShin_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3737776441" "Those who have shown great dedication in the Rulu-Shin are deemed Rularuu's Word. Their spoken word represents the voice of Rularuu in this world while he is unable to speak for himself."
// DisplayNames :
"P2765475728" "Rularuu's Word"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RuluShin_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P713944954" "The greatest members of the Rulu-Shin become Rularuu's Will. It is said every act that they take is directed by Rularuu himself."
// DisplayNames :
"P2059535567" "Rularuu's Will"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - RuluShin_Elite_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P225048443" "There a few within the organization of the Rulu-Shin who are deemed higher than those within the rank of Rularuu's Will. Some say these members talk directly to Rularuu within their dreams, though there is no actual proof of these conversations."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
