"P1763007894" "These poor chumps think they've got a chance against the Cage Consortium. Sure their working conditions are atrocious. If most of them weren't former criminals and other troublemakers maybe they could have found better jobs in St. Martial or Grandville instead of this dump."
// DisplayNames :
"P738672011" "Enraged Miner"

