"P1493514609" "Now this is disturbing. Captain Mako tore this guy to pieces years ago, yet here he stands, smashing everything in his way with his spectral hammer. You really hope every cape who has felt your wrath doesn't pull this poltergeist routine. It'll be a busy decade if they do."
// DisplayNames :
"P3091397413" "Ghost of Scrapyard"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Scrapyarders_Pet_Crazed_Demolitionist 
