// Villain Def - SpectralPirates_Minion_Low 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3149027577" "Over the years, pirates and other sailors came to the isle and were slain by the ghosts of Port Oakes. Their souls are added to this ghastly crew, which continues to grow to this very day. Beware the Night Haunt's touch, for their spectral sabers can cut flesh as well as any physical blade."
// DisplayNames :
"P4093235339" "Night Haunt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - SpectralPirates_Lieutenant_Low 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3595089118" "These ghosts look vaguely like ethereal French soldiers in their dress, but most of this is obscured by their transparent nature. Their faces are wide-eyed, while their mouths cycle constantly through a litany of screams and curses. Their hands and arms are pale red, stained with the life-force of the hundreds they've slain."
// DisplayNames :
"P3067711986" "Night Terror"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - SpectralPirates_Boss_Low 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P566207508" "In 1717, these unfortunate French soldiers were slain by Captain Blackbeard and his bloodthirsty crew. They haunt the old fort now, slaying all those who approach their spectral domain and turning them into Night Haunts. The more powerful of their victims become Night Terrors."
// DisplayNames :
"P1595873397" "Red Hand"

