"P298842824" "The Keres is among the oldest and most loyal of all the members of the Talons of Vengeance, having ascended to her current state through the blessing of the Furies themselves. She has been tasked with being a walking engine of death and destruction. She channels the bitter energy of death through all of her attacks, making her already ferocious skill with her titanic axe even more deadly. These vicious combatants are walking embodiments of the inevitability of death to those who cross the Furies. Those who are deemed 'Mother Keres' are of the highest ranks of the Talons of Vengeance, having served the Talons of Vengeance for years. It is said that they have the power to destroy entire civilizations on their own."

