// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Crystal_Titan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3203761771" "This Time Echo is of a giant crystal monster of Hamidon's creation. What, they couldn't bring an image of Hamidon itself to face you?"
// DisplayNames :
"P1062293406" "Echo of the Crystal Titan"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Hro_Dtohz 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2413467072" "This Time Echo is of the Supreme Commander of the Rikti Lineage of War, Hro'Dtohz. The Rikti... how many twists their story took since then..."
// DisplayNames :
"P3268220558" "Echo of Hro'Dtohz"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Honoree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3160740749" "This Time Echo is of the Honoree, the body of Hero 1 subjected to Rikti mutations. Before... Before... (The memory is fuzzy on this point.)"
// DisplayNames :
"P3093121395" "Echo of the Honoree"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Glacia 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1889320718" "This Time Echo is of Glacia, Omega Team survivor. Whatever is drawing these foes from your memories does not seem to care whether it is friend or foe it picks."
// DisplayNames :
"P1447704417" "Echo of Glacia"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Ghost_Widow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P934976878" "This Time Echo is of Ghost Widow, spirit and servant to Lord Recluse. You imagine she would not like her visage to be used in this way one bit."
// DisplayNames :
"P1312337505" "Echo of Ghost Widow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Black_Scorpion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P210697733" "This Time Echo of Black Scorpion stands little chance against your future self."
// DisplayNames :
"P999922076" "Echo of Black Scorpion"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Lord_Recluse 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3305610587" "Lord Recluse himself has been pulled forth as one of these Time Echoes to stop you. Unfortunately for it your future self has long since surpassed his power."
// DisplayNames :
"P2391395875" "Echo of Lord Recluse"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Positron 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3624571741" "The Time Echo of Positron has not even the conception of how powerful you have become."
// DisplayNames :
"P851872670" "Echo of Positron"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Sister_Psyche 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1099026430" "The Time Echo of Sister Psyche is clearly outmatched by your power."
// DisplayNames :
"P790193108" "Echo of Sister Psyche"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Statesman 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P250201119" "The memory of the mighty Statesman, Marcus Cole of Primal Earth, stands before you as a Time Echo drawn from your memories."
// DisplayNames :
"P1509443574" "Echo of Statesman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Ruladak 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1348311756" "Ruladak the Strong, one of the guardians of the Cathedrals of Pain, has been summoned forth from your mind as a Time Echo. It shall be banished back to the nothing from whence it came."
// DisplayNames :
"P1468336268" "Echo of Ruladak the Strong"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Imperious 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P721761905" "Imperious, Incarnate of Cimerora, is another of the Time Echoes facing you. But your connection to the Well is much stronger than his in this memory."
// DisplayNames :
"P2844356822" "Echo of Imperious"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Romulus_Nictus 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1017068908" "Even the Nictus ties to the Well cannot help this Time Echo of Romulus Augustus defeat you."
// DisplayNames :
"P186825304" "Echo of Romulus Augustus"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Reichsman 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1015196535" "Reichsman, living proof the Well responds to power, not virtue, confronts you as a Time Echo from your own memories. You will enjoy defeating him once more, even if it shall not be a true challenge."
// DisplayNames :
"P725539573" "Echo of Reichsman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Requiem 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2125098856" "Requiem's Time Echo is in over its head. If you could defeat him before you became an Incarnate, what is he to you now?"
// DisplayNames :
"P3103085045" "Echo of Requiem"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Tentacle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P282542167" "Seriously? How long has this been down here?"
// GroupDescription :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Soldiers_2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P913252207" "Vanguard is a group backed by the United Nations, and headed up by Lady Grey. Their soldiers are specifically outfitted in Impervium armor and with high tech as well as magical weaponry to fight the Rikti. Everything they do is centered around containing the Rikti menace on our world."
// DisplayNames :
"P1123143586" "Echo of Vanguard Ranger"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Sergeant_4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P682907916" "Echo of Vanguard Sergeant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Captain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3818723079" "Echo of Vanguard Colonel"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Fury_Ubermenschen_Chaingun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2475649810" "Every member of the 5th Column aspires to become one of the Raserei Ubermenschen, but few of them achieve this lofty goal. They are the spiritual and philosophical leaders of the 5th Column - totally devoted to its beliefs and goals. Like any good soldier, they lead by example. Their intense training and physical enhancements make them perfect soldiers and perfect models of behavior. In battle, they serve as an inspiration to all who fight at their side."
// DisplayNames :
"P1447678495" "Echo of Raserei Ubermenschen Force"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Fury_Ubermenschen_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1310230690" "Raserei Ubermenschen Unteroffiziere have the responsibility of leading large numbers of troops. They are concerned with training their men into peak fighting form - and recruiting new members to the cause. Until recently, none have ever been taken alive by the authorities."
// DisplayNames :
"P2460258716" "Echo of Raserei Ubermenschen Unteroffizier"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Fifth_Vampyr_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1565267706" "The Vampyri Commandants are the assistants to Nosferatu, the man responsible for the 5th Column's super soldier program. Commandants are scientists as well as super soldiers, and have a hand in the creation of other Vampyri. They often personalize their own transformation process, giving themselves special abilities and powers that lesser beings can only dream of."
// DisplayNames :
"P3300190653" "Echo of Vampyr Commandant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Eagle_high_female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2094056867" "Some of the most respected soldiers in Longbow's arsenal are the Eagles. They use advanced jetpacks and strike from on high where many of their foes can't even reach them. Their long reach makes many villains cry 'foul.'"
// DisplayNames :
"P1284426425" "Echo of Longbow Eagle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Nullifier_high 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2619684779" "Nullifiers are notorious for temporarily taking away a villain's greatest asset--his powers."
// DisplayNames :
"P1173731985" "Echo of Longbow Nullifier"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Warden_Spines_Scrapper_41-54 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2189749403" "Few volunteer for the dangerous role as a 'spines scrapper.' Those who do are almost always the most reckless and dangerous of the bunch. Villains are warned to fight them with extreme caution."
// DisplayNames :
"P3979572149" "Echo of Longbow Warden"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TimeEchoes_Mu_Striker_High 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
// DisplayNames :
"P1834222414" "Echo of Mu Striker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
