// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Trolls_Rave_Supa_Troll 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1389399754" "This is the Supa Trolls' moment of glory, for they have become what every Troll wants to be: pure incarnations of bestial fury. They have taken so much Superadine, their strength is simply amazing."
// DisplayNames :
"P1338147977" "Supa Troll"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Trolls_Troll_Bodyguard 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3161100612" "This massive Troll works as a bodyguard. A very effective bodyguard."
// DisplayNames :
"P171218219" "Troll Bodyguard"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Trolls_SigStory_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2453462809" "There's something... odd about these Trolls. Not only do they have a strange glow about them, but they appear to have gained an immense amount of power. You've never known Trolls to have strength that could threaten a member of the Freedom Phalanx."
// DisplayNames :
"P1100887135" "Trollkin"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Trolls_SigStory_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

