// Villain Def - Trolls_SigStory_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Trolls_SigStory_Atta 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P55022147" "Atta appears to have the same strange glow about him that his followers do. Whatever is giving the Trolls this unprecedented amount of power, you can be pretty sure it's not Superadine."

