// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Kama_Pha_Enforcers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1443111335" "The Pha, or Enforcers, are the foot soldiers of the Tsoo. They have yet to receive magical tattoos, and so must rely on their own strength and their weaponry. They train constantly and are especially deadly in close combat situations."
// DisplayNames :
"P652364313" "Eagle Enforcer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Claws_Pha_Enforcers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P962846842" "Tiger Enforcer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Sai_Pha_Enforcers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1350280150" "Serpent Enforcer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Katana_Pha_Enforcers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3474218405" "Dragon Enforcer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Bow_Pha_Enforcers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1622988698" "Crane Enforcer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Kama_Yellow_Ink_Men 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4168420358" "The enchanted inks used in Tsoo tattoos grant these soldiers special powers. The yellow ink enhances a Tsoo's mental powers, giving him the ability to dominate and entrance his opponents. Yellow Ink Men can easily render their victims vulnerable to attack."
// DisplayNames :
"P626013725" "Eagle Yellow Ink Man"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Sai_Yellow_Ink_Men 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1881048350" "Serpent Yellow Ink Man"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Claws_Yellow_Men 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3543726541" "Tiger Yellow Ink Man"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Katana_Yellow_Ink_Men 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2678459605" "Dragon Yellow Ink Man"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Pistol_Green_Ink_Men 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2051927445" "The enchanted inks used in Tsoo tattoos grant these soldiers special powers. The green ink enhances a Tsoo's strength, giving him powerful hand to hand attacks that can easily render a victim unconscious."
// DisplayNames :
"P2138225916" "Green Ink Man"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_SubmachineGun_Green_Ink_Men 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Shotgun_Green_Ink_Men 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Sai_Red_Men 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3623634362" "The enchanted inks used in Tsoo tattoos grant these soldiers special powers. The red ink empowers the Tsoo with the ability to drain the strength and energy from a victim and add it to his own. Red Ink Men are masters of using an opponent's strengths against him."
// DisplayNames :
"P4089353778" "Serpent Red Ink Man"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Kama_Red_Men 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1864508540" "Eagle Red Ink Man"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Claws_Red_Men 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3957634767" "Tiger Red Ink Man"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Katana_Red_Ink_Men 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P4064014430" "Dragon Red Ink Man"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Nictus_Hunter_Red_Ink_Men 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3427150083" "Quantum Red Ink Man"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Sorcerer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2725029069" "The Tsoo sorcerers are the most in touch with the Ancestor Spirits that provide the Tsoo their magic and power. They have a wide variety of powers that allow them to either attack whole groups of enemies or aid large numbers of friends, making them potent support players in any fight."
// DisplayNames :
"P2785116906" "Sorcerer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Ancestor_Spirit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1440058113" "The monstrous Ancestor Spirits are physical manifestations of the long-dead Tsoo progenitors. They're incredibly strong and tough in combat, but they're also wily. They have the ability to become intangible at will, making them slippery opponents to pin down in a fight."
// DisplayNames :
"P1542053805" "Ancestor Spirit"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_01 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4035124045" "The Dragonfly Order concentrates on the power of a few key hand to hand techniques, and on extending their inner power to control the forces of wind and rain."
// DisplayNames :
"P332018029" "Dragon Fly"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_02 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1958815305" "Masters of the Iron Hand technique have trained their fists to break metal. They have detailed knowledge of human pressure points, which they use to drain the life from a foe and replace their own energies."
// DisplayNames :
"P3948135479" "Iron Hands"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_03 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1991331598" "Bronze Leopard Masters use claw-like weapons to deadly effect. They disdain the more spectacular uses of Tsoo power, preferring to concentrate on physical techniques."
// DisplayNames :
"P1212522553" "Bronze Leopard"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_04 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1756083614" "The Swift Steel school emphasizes speed of body and of blade. Masters of the school's techniques can extend their inner power to alter the speed and rhythms of combat, slowing and limiting the power of their foes."
// DisplayNames :
"P4009607791" "Swift Steel"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_05 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2754145309" "Through special alchemies and meditations, masters of the Ice Wind technique have taken on the powers of winter's fiercest storms. Their chilling techniques can leave a foe frozen and helpless beneath an onslaught of ice."
// DisplayNames :
"P3492529638" "Ice Wind"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_06 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3491080209" "The Midnight Order draws its fearsome might from the darkest places within the spirit, amplifying and focusing this darkness into a number of devastating attacks."
// DisplayNames :
"P2366223525" "Midnight"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_07 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2942654732" "Masters of the Death Moon school have learned to tap into the powers of life and death. They can draw out an enemy's life, or concentrate the negative energies of the spirit to grant themselves power."
// DisplayNames :
"P565562019" "Death Moon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_08 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2368416998" "Lightning Blade techniques concentrate on mastering the chaotic powers of electricity and matching it with fearsome sword skills. A disciple of the Lightning Blade school can channel the power of lightning into every attack."
// DisplayNames :
"P4242430351" "Lightning Blade"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_09 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1024520794" "Masters of the art of the Fire Dagger have suffused their internal energies with the power of flame. Fire comes to their fingertips at a whim, allowing them to devastate their foes."
// DisplayNames :
"P2350430848" "Fire Dagger"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_10 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P866265632" "The powerful strikes of the Lost Son technique are used in conjunction with deadly knowledge of human pressure points. Masters of this technique can easily cripple and incapacitate their foes."
// DisplayNames :
"P1638730055" "Lost Son"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_11 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3091755902" "The Death's Head Order has mastered and fused techniques from both the Midnight and Death Moon schools. The order's disciples are masters of a devastating martial art based around control of darkness and shadow. It is said they can kill without even striking."
// DisplayNames :
"P2579490756" "Death's Head"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_12 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2570245727" "The Viridian Fear techniques are based around amplifying and controlling the power of fear itself. A Viridian Fear master can use shadow techniques to manifest the very fears of his enemies."
// DisplayNames :
"P3121026468" "Viridian Fear"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_13 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3680412137" "Members of the Copper Serpent Order suffuse their bodies with toxins to utilize their deadly poison-based martial art. Masters of the style gain the dreaded Body Fang ability, and can create poison thorns on their skin at will."
// DisplayNames :
"P1330034055" "Copper Serpent"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_14 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P56298688" "The Far Fire style utilizes the Tsoo's internal energy to burn the very air. Far Fire masters can hurl flame at enemies to burn, blind, or entrap them."
// DisplayNames :
"P4187138417" "Far Fire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_15 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P482209212" "Masters of the Crescent style have learned to tap into the very power of the universe itself and focus it through their own bodies. This power enhances their strength and allows them to alter reality around their foes."
// DisplayNames :
"P2484436409" "Crescent"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_16 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4016507731" "The masters called Heralds have sharpened their mental focus to a deadly weapon. They can use the power of their will to render their enemies helpless before their weapons."
// DisplayNames :
"P145725813" "Herald"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Boss_17 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1217784543" "The Sky Fall technique requires incredible internal power to master. Those who have attained it become elemental forces empowered with the might of the storm."
// DisplayNames :
"P2700144496" "Sky Fall"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_CoV_Sai_Red_Men 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2640415757" "The enchanted inks used in Tsoo tattoos grant these soldiers special powers. The blue ink empowers the Tsoo with the ability to drain the strength and energy from a victim and add it to his own. Blue Ink Men are masters of using an opponent's strengths again him."
