"P818925907" "Chi Masters are strong, capable combatants who use an attackers strength against them."
// DisplayNames :
"P3938611750" "Chi Master"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Thunder_Leopard 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4182424533" "Thunder Leopard is the youngest of Sun Xiong's favored disciples, and struggles to earn the respect of his seniors. He has trains in the ancient art of Nrig Xub Tua, allowing him to sheathe his own fists with powerful electric energy."
// DisplayNames :
"P1340481125" "Thunder Leopard"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Silver_Serpent 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P213404514" "Silver Serpent has trained with Sun Xiong for as long as she can remember. Under her master's watchful eye, she has mastered the use of the Katana and wields it with deadly precision."
