"P1756773384" "Silver Serpent"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Tsoo_Iron_Crane 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3807323316" "Iron Crane is the eldest of Sun Xiong's favored disciples. He has trained rigorously for decades, hardening his body and learning to strike with deadly speed."
