// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2386827703" "This Tsoo sorcerer has completed the rituals necessary to accept an Ancestral Spirit into his body. This manifests as an otherworldly glow that seems to emerge from his tattoos. Becoming imbued with the power of an Ancestor grants a sorcerer unique powers, including the ability to call forth lightning from the sky and even control time itself. Additionally, he has been blessed by his ancestor spirit with greater combat ability, which manifests in the form of kinetic melee fighting."
// DisplayNames :
