"P1702688358" "Turrets like these are rumored to be based on designs stolen (or bought) from Crey industries. This one matches the design for a Chain-Gun turret. The Crey security catalog entry reads: 'Our basic model of chain-gun turret provides constant volumes of fire, capable of dissuading most intruders.'"
// DisplayNames :
"P3244788208" "Chain-Gun Turret"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Turrets_PopUp_Turret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3317327571" "Turrets like these are rumored to be based on designs stolen (or bought) from Crey industries. This one matches the design for a Pop-Up Anti-Personnel turret. The Crey security catalog entry reads: 'Our hidden turrets can be a placed as nasty surprise for anyone who thinks they've bypassed your security.'"
// DisplayNames :
"P4042540563" "Pop Up Anti-Personnel Gun"

