// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P641813646" "Turrets like these are rumored to be based on designs stolen (or bought) from Crey industries. This one matches the design for a Incendiary Missile Turret. The Crey security catalog entry reads: 'When the Crey labs came up with a powerful new incendiary formula, it didn't take us a minute to think of modifying our already popular Missile Turrets to take advantage of it. We think you'll like the results.'"
// DisplayNames :
"P3144510668" "Incendiary Missile Turret"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Turrets_Gas_Missile_Turret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3220984525" "Turrets like these are rumored to be based on designs stolen (or bought) from Crey industries. This one matches the design for a Toxic Gas Missile Turret. The Crey security catalog entry reads: 'Sometimes even the strongest conventional defense isn't enough to dissuade some of the stranger threats your installation may face. Crey Industries is ready to provide you with the perfect solution when you need maximum levels of non-conventional force. Our Toxic Gas Missile Turrets can suppress even the most unconventional of foes with their deadly vapors.'"
// DisplayNames :
"P3929478591" "Toxic Gas Missile Turret"

