// DisplayNames :
"P567581038" "Mortificator Quantum Gunner"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Vahzilok_Nictus_Hunter_Eidolon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P116994314" "In Dr. Vahzilok's mind, the Eidolons are mankind's next great evolutionary leap. Unlike the cadavers, they retain all of their memories and personality. The lucky few who can pay to become a Eidolon are augmented with the remains of heroes, so they often have super powers. Quantum Eidolons have mastered the ability to control darkness itself. They tend to root their foes with tendrils of darkness and then launch into an attack."
// DisplayNames :
"P2837908791" "Quantum Eidolon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Vahzilok_Nictus_Hunter_Eidolon_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Vahzilok_Vahzilok_Barrel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P154245528" "This barrel contains a powerful drug that will weaken the immune system of Paragon City's people. You must destroy it before it's introduced to the water supply."
// GroupDescription :
// DisplayNames :
"P2478093621" "Toxic Waste"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Vahzilok_Cortex 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P757966150" "Dr. Vahzilok has sent one of his most powerful disciples to ensure that his plan to poison the dam goes off without a hitch. It is rumored that Cortex was a hero once. It's hard to believe that now."
// DisplayNames :
"P4160157578" "Cortex"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Vahzilok_Face_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P879089199" "Some people will do anything for beauty. And then there are the Faces. Star patients of the Facemaker, they've learned the secrets of the Vahzilok and now will do anything they can to make themselves beautiful."
// DisplayNames :
"P947454249" "Face Reaper"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Vahzilok_Face_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2282870748" "Face Harvester"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Vahzilok_Facemaker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1736690647" "The woman called the Facemaker was once a disciple of Dr. Vahzilok in Paragon City. She still admires the mad doctor's work, but decided to strike out on her own to pursue her own amoral vision of life and beauty."
// DisplayNames :
"P3578962601" "The Facemaker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Vahzilok_Doc_Buzzsaw 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2263533222" "Doc Buzzsaw is one of Dr. Vahzilok's most promising disciples. Her knowledge of cybernetics has proven invaluable to the Doctor's crusade to cure the human condition and bring humanity to the next stage of evolution. Recent difficulties with Paragon City's heroes have begun to strain their relationship, and it seems only a matter of time before Doc Buzzsaw buzzes off."
// DisplayNames :
"P1791587215" "Doc Buzzsaw"

