"P3510836316" "Spectral Servant Decoy"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Vindicators_Ms_Liberty 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1696302701" "Megan is the daughter of the original Miss Liberty from the Golden Age. She has taken up the mantle to fight for freedom, in this specific case to free Paragon City from its infestation of villains. She has heightened strength and endurance as well as the power of the Liberty Belt, which was passed on to her by her grandmother."
// DisplayNames :
"P2932165423" "Ms. Liberty"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
